WEBVTT

00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:16,400
This question, reading about generic oxygen therapy, I'm surprised to find a little to

00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:28,000
know, little to support it as effective on its own against cancer. There are studies showing

00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,760
effectiveness in conjunction with chemotherapy and radiation, lowering cancer resistance,

00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:40,960
cells resistance, but studies that show hyperbaric oxygen therapy, that's H-bot, hyperbaric oxygen

00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:46,640
therapy, that's you're in a hyperbaric oxygen chamber, that's what this person's talking about,

00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:54,560
about oxygen therapy. So hyperbaric oxygen therapy effectiveness on its own don't seem to exist

00:00:55,200 --> 00:01:04,240
is this what you have found also. So, you know, I've also said this before, it's hard to get

00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:14,800
a study approved unless you're combining it with chemotherapy or radiation. So if you're going

00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:24,320
to combine, you know, if you're going to do a study on curcumin as a beneficial nutrient for

00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:30,320
cancer patients, most a lot of the studies that you're going to Google and find out there are studies

00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:36,480
that are saying people who are on chemotherapy and doing curcumin are do do better than people

00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:41,840
that are on chemotherapy are not doing curcumin. Well, what about those who are doing chemotherapy?

00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:47,840
Well, they couldn't get approval for their study and they can't get study dollars money

00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:58,720
to run a study unless it's tied with chemotherapy or radiation. That's just the financial situation

00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:06,720
with trying to get the national institutes of health to authorize a study and to get funding,

00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:11,440
government to fund because mostly studies that are done on cancer are done with governmental

00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:20,640
grants or they're funded by the drug company itself. So, what's the benefit of a drug company

00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:29,840
who sells chemotherapy to fund a study using HBOT with chemotherapy? Well, the reason is that

00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:35,840
they realize that there's a large percentage of people that are going to use curcumin and

00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:43,040
green tea extract and verborid and HBOT and things. So, they might as well cash hit on that and

00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:50,000
they do it they do a study that is done with chemotherapy and radiation. They're by giving evidence

00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:59,280
that and giving information to the general public that you of course everybody does chemotherapy

00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:08,000
and radiation. So, it's kind of a mind game that they play with people too. So, it is difficult

00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:14,160
to find research and I've said this multiple times before that unless you couple research with

00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:20,960
chemotherapy and radiation, meaning unless you couple research with current standards of care,

00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:26,640
it's going to be difficult to get a study approved and number two, it's going to be difficult to get

00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:32,000
funding to do a study. It's very expensive to do a study. People have asked why are there more

00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:42,160
studies on RIF technology because there's no money in it and to get a study approved for something

00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:51,280
that costs a lot of money and they're not going to approve a study on doing RIF therapy versus

00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:58,560
doing chemotherapy or they're not going to approve a study doing HBOT versus doing chemotherapy

00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:04,560
or curcumin versus chemotherapy. They're never going to approve that study. It's never going to

00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:09,280
be approved. Why? Because the drug companies control the national interests of health. You'll never get

00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:15,280
approval to do a study like that because quite honestly they'd be afraid of the outcome.

00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:31,200
So, and then secondly, you won't get funding. So, you just kind of have to understand that.

